{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56329","headline":"访李真人 · 周源","name":"访李真人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八十康强鬓未华，琴书图史是生涯。\n是非应不关心虑，名利何曾挂齿牙。\n野鹤无心栖道院，岩花流水入仙家。\n□□□□□□□，近闻巢许出烟霞。\n（见道光《宝庆府志》卷一○三《艺文略四·金石一》。\n此诗承陶敏先生录示。\n）（按：《宝庆府志》云此诗刻石在郡南百里高霞山。\n李真人名震，显庆间修真於此，白昼冲举。\n周尚书源过访留诗，勒碑新甲山仙宅。\n万历间江涸碑见，获此诗，泐第七句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}